</figure>
<div id="S5.SS7.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS7.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The results confirm that entropy regularization provides a better accuracy-sparsity trade-off in natural language tasks.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.8 </span>Task 7: Large-Scale Vision Validation</h3>

<div id="S5.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To address scalability concerns, we conduct experiments on ImageNet with ViT-Base and evaluate computational overhead.</p>
</div>
<section id="S5.SS8.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">5.8.1 </span>ImageNet Classification</h4>

<div id="S5.SS8.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS8.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS8.SSS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Setup</span>: ViT-Base/16 on ImageNet-1K with entropy regularization applied to all attention layers.</p>
</div>
<div id="S5.SS8.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS8.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS8.SSS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results</span>: Table <a href="#S5.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ 5.8.1 ImageNet Classification ‣ 5.8 Task 7: Large-Scale Vision Validation ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Differentiable Entropy Regularization for Geometry and Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows results across different sparsity levels. Our method maintains competitive accuracy while achieving significant FLOPs reduction.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>ImageNet-1K Results with ViT-Base/16</figcaption>
