</section>
<section id="S5.SS8.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">5.8.2 </span>Computational Overhead Analysis</h4>

<div id="S5.SS8.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS8.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The overhead of computing <math id="S5.SS8.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\text{diff}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>diff</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\text{diff}}</annotation></semantics></math> scales as <math id="S5.SS8.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(N^{2}k)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(N^{2}k)</annotation></semantics></math> for attention with sequence length <math id="S5.SS8.SSS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>. Table <a href="#S5.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ 5.8.2 Computational Overhead Analysis ‣ 5.8 Task 7: Large-Scale Vision Validation ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Differentiable Entropy Regularization for Geometry and Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> shows training time overhead across different model sizes.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Training Time Overhead Analysis</figcaption>
<table id="S5.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S5.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Model</th>
<th id="S5.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Sequence Length</th>
<th id="S5.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Overhead (%)</th>
<th id="S5.T8.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Memory Increase (%)</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
