<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All geometric experiments were run on a machine with an Intel Core i9-12900K CPU and 64GB of RAM. Attention experiments were run on a single NVIDIA A100 GPU with 40GB of VRAM. Key architectural details and hyperparameters are provided in Table <a href="#A1.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ A.1 Experimental Protocols ‣ Appendix A Reproducibility ‣ Differentiable Entropy Regularization for Geometry and Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.</p>
</div>
